Z||000006||frontal lobe||09-29-2000||06:23 PM||||Well I thought it was funny.<P>But then I just sold my '86GT with 112,000 miles on it because it had a LOUD rod knock.  I have an '87GT already so I didn't want to put the money into fixing the other one.  Well, the guy I sold it to has THREE '86GT's already.  He was going to use mine as a parts car, but liked it and thought it was too good for that, so he's having it repaired.<P>He also has several 1960's corvettes and 1950's t-birds.  He has a miserable existence, however, and he must occasionally go around and start and run his over 25! cars, work the a/c, etc.  Ay yes, life is hard.||||reg||1
